      "identity": "class cv.cuda.StereoSGM",
      "returnType": ": cv::StereoSGBM",
      "modifiers": [],
      "arguments": [],
      "enumValues": [],
      "baseDeclaration": ": cv::StereoSGBM",
      "documentation": "@brief The class implements the modified H. Hirschmuller algorithm @cite HH08.\nLimitation and difference are as follows:\n\n-   By default, the algorithm uses only 4 directions which are horizontal and vertical path instead of 8.\nSet mode=StereoSGM::MODE_HH in createStereoSGM to run the full variant of the algorithm.\n-   Mutual Information cost function is not implemented.\nInstead, Center-Symmetric Census Transform with \\f$9 \\times 7\\f$ window size from @cite Spangenberg2013\nis used for robustness.\n\n@sa cv::StereoSGBM"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "sourceHeader": "opencv-source/opencv_contrib-5.0.0/modules/cudastereo/include/opencv2/cudastereo.hpp",
      "kind": "callable",
